This repository distributes the official binary packages of dupEx. dupEx is proprietary software:
its source code is not published here and is not covered by an open-source licence.

The binding terms for downloading and using these packages are the dupEx Terms and Conditions:

    https://ewitsolutions.com/apps/terms-and-conditions

Two facts stated on the product page, for orientation only — the Terms above are what applies:

  * Scanning, finding and inspecting duplicates is free of charge. Deleting files is reserved for
    the paid editions and needs a licence key.
  * Every artifact on the release pages is signed. The public key is published alongside them as
    dupex-release-key.asc, and SHA256SUMS lists the digests.

